<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  FTA411 Approval Summary (FTAR411, the "tenure billing batch summary"): what the range billing
  batch (FTA_690_TENURE_APPROVAL.PROCESS) did with one FTA_RANGE_BILL_REQUEST, e-mailed to the
  user who submitted it.

  Legacy was the Crystal report fta-archive crystal-reports/application/fta411-ApprovalSummary.rpt,
  whose layout and query are in compressed Crystal streams that could not be read. Its data shape
  is THE.FTA_411_PKG.rec_FTA411 (org_unit_code, submit_userid, calendar_year, curr_time,
  curr_date, total_invoices, first_invoice, last_invoice, invoice_total, message_text,
  current_server), filled here from the request row (RangeBillingPackage.SUMMARY_SQL). The layout
  is new: one page listing those values.
-->
